[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そういえばイザナ元気かしら？\u3000最近見ないわよね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Speaking of which, I wonder how Izana's doing? Haven't seen her in a while."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "今は王都のほうで修行中だよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "She's training in the capital right now."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "でも、騎士試験には受かったんでしょ？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "But she passed the knight exam, right?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "うん、筆記も実技もバッチリ！\nだから、正式に騎士として訓練を積んでる最中みたい",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yep! She aced both the written and practical tests! Now she's officially training as a knight."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ロマンさんがときどき様子を教えてくれるんだけど、\n毎日ユナさんがつきっきりで鍛えてくれてるって",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Roman keeps me updated—apparently Juna's been personally overseeing her training every day."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "へえ……それは私もちょっと興味あるわね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hmm... Now that's something I'd like to see."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "――っ！\u3000誰？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "—Wait! Who's there?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "よく気配に気付いたな！\u3000さすがと言っておこう！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Well spotted! I must say, I'm impressed!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "？？？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "???"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "錬金術士レスナ・シュテルネンリヒトだな！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You must be Resna Sternenlicht, the alchemist!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "？？？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "???"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "私に何かご用ですか？\nええと、そちらのお名前は？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Did you need something from me? Um, and you are...?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "私はゴゥだ。こちらは自慢の妹リーベ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I am Gou. And this is my pride and joy, my sister Liebe."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ゴゥ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Gou"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "不躾ではありますが、襲わせて頂きます",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Pardon our rudeness, but we must test your strength."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "リーベ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Liebe"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "えぇ！？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "What?!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "パルメ族の庇護を受けずに大海を渡る力があるか、\nそれを確認したいのです",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "We wish to see if you possess the power to cross the great sea without the Palme's protection."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "リーベ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Liebe"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "っ！\u3000パルメ族……！？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "The Palme...?!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（じゃあ、この人たちは師匠の……！）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(Then these people must be connected to Miss Saskia...!)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "出でよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Come forth."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "リーベ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Liebe"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（これは……師匠たちが使役していたのと同じ！）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(This is... the same kind of power that Miss Saskia wielded!)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ええ！\u3000やるわよ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Right! Let's do this!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "力を持たぬなら、退くことをお勧めします",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "If you lack the strength, I suggest you withdraw."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "リーベ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Liebe"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "退くなんてできません！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "We won't back down!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ぶっ倒してやるわ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "We'll take you down!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あなたたちの力、確かめさせていただきます",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Then show me the extent of your power."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "リーベ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Liebe"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "上等よ。好きなだけ見せてあげる！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Fine by me. We'll show you everything we've got!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 26,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "うむ、頑張っているな。\nはたして、いつまで続くかな",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hmm, you're doing well. Let's see how long you can keep this up."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ゴゥ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Gou"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 27,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あなたがたが何者かは存じ上げませんが……\n私たちの邪魔はさせません！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I don't know who you are... but we won't let you stop us!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 28,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "レスナ、あと一息よ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna, just a little more!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 29,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "うん！\u3000絶対に勝とう！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yeah! We'll definitely win!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 30,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "リーベの兄を名乗る、はつらつとした男。\nパルメ族と関係がありそうだ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "A spirited man who claims to be Liebe's brother. Seems to have connections to the Palme."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ゴゥ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Gou"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 31,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "突然現れた二人組のうちの一人で、ゴゥの妹。\n落ち着いた佇まいで知性を感じさせる",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "One of the mysterious duo who suddenly appeared, Gou's sister. Her composed demeanor suggests a sharp intellect."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "リーベ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Liebe"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]